{"id":"b4d7921597565c97","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-lefschetz-number-data.md","title":"Lefschetz Number from Rational Singular Chains","display":"df-lefschetz-number-data — Lefschetz Number from Rational Singular Chains","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-lefschetz-number-data","aliases":["58-df-lefschetz-number-data"],"display":"df-lefschetz-number-data — Lefschetz Number from Rational Singular Chains","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-lefschetz-number-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-lefschetz-number-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lefschetz-number-data — Lefschetz Number from Rational Singular Chains"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"78ee5e5ffa2f4a64\" href=\"?note=78ee5e5ffa2f4a64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a061d5c71f82e51\" href=\"?note=3a061d5c71f82e51\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md\">../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,V_K,f,h,\\ell\\in V\">\\(K,V_K,f,h,\\ell\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|K|\">\\(|K|\\)</span> 为单纯复形依赖中以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_K\">\\(V_K\\)</span> 为顶点集的几何实现；未使用的顶点坐标恒为零。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_K,\\tau_K,\\sigma_K\">\\(Y_K,\\tau_K,\\sigma_K\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V_K)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\">\\(\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V_K)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\\)</span> 下定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_K\">\\(\\sigma_K\\)</span> 使用有理数的通常加法、乘法与单位。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_n(\\sigma),B_n(\\sigma),g^{\\#}_{\\sigma,\\sigma,n}\">\\(Z_n(\\sigma),B_n(\\sigma),g^{\\#}_{\\sigma,\\sigma,n}\\)</span> 使用系数奇异链依赖。有限个函数的线性组合逐点计算；长度为零时取零函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in Z_n(\\sigma)^r\">\\(b\\in Z_n(\\sigma)^r\\)</span> 表示长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的闭链序列，并不声称各闭链在线性链空间中构成基。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(i,j)\">\\(M(i,j)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\">\\(M(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bij}(h,A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Bij}(h,A,B)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in B^A\\land\\operatorname{ran}h=B\\land\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\;(h(a)=h(a&#39;)\\to a=a&#39;)\">\\(h\\in B^A\\land\\operatorname{ran}h=B\\land\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\;(h(a)=h(a&#39;)\\to a=a&#39;)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h^{-1}\">\\(h^{-1}\\)</span> 仅在此条件下使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}\">\\(\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LefschetzNumber}\">\\(\\mathrm{LefschetzNumber}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RationalHomologyMatrix58}\">\\(\\mathrm{RationalHomologyMatrix58}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nY_K&amp;\\coloneqq|K|,\\\\\n\\tau_K&amp;\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq Y_K:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\{y\\in Y_K:\\sum_{v\\in\\bigcup K}(x(v)-y(v))^2&lt;\\varepsilon^2\\}\\subseteq U\\},\\\\\n\\sigma_K&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle Y_K,\\tau_K,\\mathbb Q,+,\\cdot,0,1\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nY_K&amp;\\coloneqq|K|,\\\\\n\\tau_K&amp;\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq Y_K:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\{y\\in Y_K:\\sum_{v\\in\\bigcup K}(x(v)-y(v))^2&lt;\\varepsilon^2\\}\\subseteq U\\},\\\\\n\\sigma_K&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle Y_K,\\tau_K,\\mathbb Q,+,\\cdot,0,1\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RationalHomologyMatrix58}_S(M,b,g,\\sigma,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists Y,\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\\sigma=\\langle Y,\\tau,\\mathbb Q,+,\\cdot,0,1\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(g,Y,\\tau,Y,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(b\\in Z_n(\\sigma)^r\\land M\\in\\mathbb Q^{r\\times r}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl[\\forall z\\in Z_n(\\sigma)\\;\\exists!c\\in\\mathbb Q^r\\;\n\\bigl(z-\\sum_{i\\in r}c(i)b(i)\\in B_n(\\sigma)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall j\\in r\\;\\bigl(g^{\\#}_{\\sigma,\\sigma,n}(b(j))-\\sum_{i\\in r}M(i,j)b(i)\\in B_n(\\sigma)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RationalHomologyMatrix58}_S(M,b,g,\\sigma,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists Y,\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\\sigma=\\langle Y,\\tau,\\mathbb Q,+,\\cdot,0,1\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(g,Y,\\tau,Y,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(b\\in Z_n(\\sigma)^r\\land M\\in\\mathbb Q^{r\\times r}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl[\\forall z\\in Z_n(\\sigma)\\;\\exists!c\\in\\mathbb Q^r\\;\n\\bigl(z-\\sum_{i\\in r}c(i)b(i)\\in B_n(\\sigma)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall j\\in r\\;\\bigl(g^{\\#}_{\\sigma,\\sigma,n}(b(j))-\\sum_{i\\in r}M(i,j)b(i)\\in B_n(\\sigma)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LefschetzNumber}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\ell;f,K,V_K,h)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V_K)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\\land\\ell\\in\\mathbb Q\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Bij}(h,Y_K,\\operatorname{ran}h)\\land f\\in(\\operatorname{ran}h)^{\\operatorname{ran}h}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(h^{-1}\\circ f\\circ h,Y_K,\\tau_K,Y_K,\\tau_K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\omega^{\\dim K+1}\\;\\exists b,M\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\dim K+1,\\operatorname{ran}b)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M,\\dim K+1,\\operatorname{ran}M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl[\\forall i\\in\\dim K+1\\;\\bigl(b(i)\\in Z_i(\\sigma_K)^{r(i)}\\land M(i)\\in\\mathbb Q^{r(i)\\times r(i)}\n\\land\\mathrm{RationalHomologyMatrix58}_S(M(i),b(i),h^{-1}\\circ f\\circ h,\\sigma_K,i)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\ell=\\sum_{i\\in\\dim K+1}(-1)^i\\sum_{j\\in r(i)}M(i)(j,j)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LefschetzNumber}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\ell;f,K,V_K,h)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V_K)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(K)\\land\\ell\\in\\mathbb Q\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Bij}(h,Y_K,\\operatorname{ran}h)\\land f\\in(\\operatorname{ran}h)^{\\operatorname{ran}h}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(h^{-1}\\circ f\\circ h,Y_K,\\tau_K,Y_K,\\tau_K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\omega^{\\dim K+1}\\;\\exists b,M\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\dim K+1,\\operatorname{ran}b)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M,\\dim K+1,\\operatorname{ran}M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl[\\forall i\\in\\dim K+1\\;\\bigl(b(i)\\in Z_i(\\sigma_K)^{r(i)}\\land M(i)\\in\\mathbb Q^{r(i)\\times r(i)}\n\\land\\mathrm{RationalHomologyMatrix58}_S(M(i),b(i),h^{-1}\\circ f\\circ h,\\sigma_K,i)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\ell=\\sum_{i\\in\\dim K+1}(-1)^i\\sum_{j\\in r(i)}M(i)(j,j)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>有理同调的基以闭链代表元给出；唯一坐标条件按模边界陈述。矩阵系数直接由连续映射对奇异单形的复合得到，不把“诱导映射”作为任意附加数据。</li>\n<li>取迹不依赖所选择的代表元与同调基。空复形的次数索引是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，交错和为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>原五参数元层接口名称保留；新增内容只给该接口实际定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"78ee5e5ffa2f4a64","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"3a061d5c71f82e51","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}$ 取 [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Continuous}$ 取 [[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,V_K,f,h,\\ell\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"|K|","display":false},{"tex":